{"id":14746343732,"name":"TashTram - Трамвай Ташкента","desc":"Симулятор трамвая, троллейбуса и автобуса. Ташкентский трамвай.\nTram, trolleybus and bus simulator. Tashkent tram.\n\nПолучите удовольствие от поездки по маршрутам Ташкентского трамвая, троллейбуса или автобуса.\n\nВ следующем обновлении:\n+ Новые линии маршрутов.\n+ Новые модели трамваев.\n+ Небольшая детализация городской среды. \n\nСообщайте о проблеме, если она возникла. Хорошей поездки!\n\nNext update:\n+ New route lines\n+ New models of trams\n+ Small detailing of the urban environment.\n\nLet me know if there is a problem. Have a good trip!\n","path":"/game/14746343732-tashtram","slug":"14746343732-tashtram","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b7da7ffd5039cfb99ac45c6e43906a28c815907cb2fa8a510c87bce8c4ffd8a1.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b76c813eb96a4b91cac7e90d54760e2a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":184,"visitor":7823481,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-12-07T15:09:07.435Z","creator":{"name":"Rukkakola","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"69359893ccb38cc427ee8029","title":"Inf Coins","game":{"_id":"69359893ccb38cc427ee8026","gameId":14746343732,"name":"TashTram - Трамвай Ташкента","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"14746343732-tashtram","path":"/game/14746343732-tashtram","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":14746343732},"slug":"TashTram-Tramvaj-Tashkenta-Inf-Coins-73269","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":1125,"executes":355,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-a3a9fe0daaa0e07398072bf73e0a01fc-44fc5c65e290.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-a3a9fe0daaa0e07398072bf73